Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing Yoshikage\NKira despises more than.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sticking out in a crowd or\Nbeing the center of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think I'd suffer such a sickening\Nhumiliation in front of total strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart attack pilots itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could it be ensnared?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's\Ncausing this to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have to reverse\Nit before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going down there, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we help you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look like you're doing so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can call your mama for you if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, did you catch what this dude said?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he had too much booze,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now this sloppy drunk has\Nforgotten how to use his manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you enjoying the buzz?
