Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice suit you got there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my home dog just got\Nfired and we're flat broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ladies ain't exactly lining up either,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so when I see broskies\Nlike you, I get agitated!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just lie there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your shoelaces are untied.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a knot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck getting them\Nsuckers loose again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shitballs, what the hell did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a bomb made by my stand's power,\Nand that was Deadly Queen's Bomb Type 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.96,0:01:55.59,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,{\an8}G-Get a doctor! I need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today has been a complete disaster.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.59,0:01:58.55,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Get me a fucking doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All Yoshikage Kira wanted to do\Nwas live a simple, quiet life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those meddling\Nmaggots just had to stick
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their wretched noses\Nwhere they didn't belong.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.79,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.79,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.79,0:02:31.21,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.79,0:02:31.21,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.59,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.59,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.59,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.38,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.38,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.38,0:02:39.76,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.38,0:02:39.76,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.76,0:02:43.22,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.76,0:02:43.22,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.22,0:02:47.56,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}tsuranuita ya no youna surudosa de
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.22,0:02:47.56,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Those who fight with a heart pierced by the arrow
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.56,0:02:51.06,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}butsukeau kokoro wa utsukushii
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.56,0:02:51.06,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Are a beautiful sight to behold
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.06,0:02:52.11,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.06,0:02:52.11,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.73,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.73,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.73,0:02:55.86,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}itsumo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.73,0:02:55.86,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I'll always chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always chase you, I always chase you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.03,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}ore wa chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.03,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I will chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to run away.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.61,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}nigeba wa nai
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.61,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}You can't escape me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always chase you. I always chase you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.61,0:03:02.28,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}hashiridase chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.61,0:03:02.28,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Run faster as I chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.41,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}asu mo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.41,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Even tomorrow I'll chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it again!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.41,0:03:07.29,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}tataki tsukete yaru no sa
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.41,0:03:07.29,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Until I finally pummel you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.29,0:03:12.92,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shunen sa
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.29,0:03:12.92,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}My perseverance will propel me forward to achieve victory
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.29,0:03:12.92,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shuunen sa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I chase you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.92,0:03:18.80,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}dakara I Chase You
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.92,0:03:18.80,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}Which is why I chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.63,0:03:24.76,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 24: {\fs80} Sheer Heart Attack, Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.63,0:03:24.76,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 24: {\fs80} Sheer Heart Attack Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.47,0:03:23.97,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, Josuke...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.43,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}The hell's goin' on at Centipede Shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened at that shoe shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still kind of confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi couldn't really explain it over\Nthe phone, but it didn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take about five\Nminutes to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You managed to crack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if the bomb stand took damage, then\Nits user just got a nasty surprise too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please do not venture\Ntoo far from my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so you're aware, my\Nrange is five meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see this comes as a shock to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, we've indeed matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our power is much greater than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My inferior range in comparison with\NAct 2 is an unavoidable shortcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving outside my 5 meter range removes\Nthe weight applied to the target object.
