Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.51,0:04:01.47,Episode 24 Typesetting 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\pos(836,875)}5 Meters
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.55,0:04:04.05,Main,Echoes,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you were to move more than five meters away from that thing, \Nthe weight afflicting it would disappear...
