Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now I want him right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope Josuke gets here\Nbefore Trouble shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I hear a new gym is getting\Nready to open near Budogaoka High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And given today's events,\NI'm now considering joining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably build up my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, I haven't\Nhad the best luck lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could end up sharing weights with or\Nswimming in the same pool as the dregs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who'd rather play with\Ntheir dicks than bathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me a total of\Nthree minutes to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized the full extent of my weakness\Nas I tried to traverse the crosswalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many guests should I be\Nexpecting to join this party?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You phone someone asking for help, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata and\NOkuyasu Nijimura are closest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and being about five minutes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd wager they have two minutes to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of their best\Nfriends, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako Yamagishi and that\Nhaughty woman who runs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beauty Institute Cinderella\Nare stand users as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I severely doubt you'd turn to\Nthem for help in your hour of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all the confusion, I\Nmisplaced my other jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter, I'll retrieve it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I must do away with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the man we're all after!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Year after year, you've killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you even remember them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reimi? Shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi?
