Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this guy have two stands?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought a user could only possess one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Deadly Queen is my actual stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart Attack is a smart bomb which\NI launch from the stand's left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the damage I've received\Nhas been contained to my left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we proceed, Master Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should know that you've just left\Nthe parameters of the 5-meter range.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The force suppressing his\Nbomb stand will dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-H-I-T.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it has escaped, I will have\Nto initiate three frees again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand's range is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of them shall be\Nthe target of my attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The actual murderer or that\Npiece-of-shit bomb stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Master, three frees\Ncannot weigh down two targets at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we immobilize the user,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bomb stand will just keep\Ncharging at us on autopilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we stop the bomb, the\Nuser will rush in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which will it be, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your orders before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To whom shall I direct my attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find your target is the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze! Freeze!
