Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:07:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A valiant effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it appears you were\Ndestined for defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter which of us\Nyou decided to target.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think Heart Attack was\Nmy invincible ace in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined it would be\Nrendered completely ineffective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to compensate a cafe, and\Nthen I had a run-in with some thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truthfully, I feel like\NI've been taken for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never have I been so\Nchallenged in such a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've been left with a\Nslight taste of defeat in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you've certainly earned\Nmy deepest respects, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, you wouldn't happen to\Nhave any tissues on hand, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A handkerchief would also do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gone out of my way\Nto pay you my respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least you could do\Nwas converse with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly now, your nose is gushing blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I offered it so you\Ncould clean yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to beat you\Ninto a bloody puddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in just over a minute, your\Nfriends will arrive to find nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving you alive just\Ndoesn't sit right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially after the public\Nhumiliation I endured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, put a sock in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better yet, why not take the whole foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day has gifted me with the\Nexact same pain you're feeling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accepted it with grace as opposed to\Nyour tedious whining, you mewling Cameo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit back and watch a real man work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tissues come in handy, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood or otherwise, they say a stuffy\Nnose is a sure path to slow cognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's any consolation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not too long ago, I was groveling\Non the ground just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In one minute, I will vaporize\Nyou with Deadly Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, why don't you learn from\Nyours truly and put up with the pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn to be tough in\Nthe face of resistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was say your name, Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta look at my driver's license,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when did you have the\Nchance to bill for my wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you pathetic little bootlicker?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You reimbursed the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have given me\Na better clue if I'd asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see how the two are related.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, learning my name\Nnow does you a little good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a matter of moments,\Nyou'll cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, believe me, I know all\Ntoo well what's about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, if a pathetic bootlicker like\Nme can figure out your name that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not as tough\Nas you seem to think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, you might get away for the\Ntime being, but you know what, Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet your every thought\Nis mocking me for letting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a whiny brat unravel the\Nmystery of your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they aren't, I'll\Ndo the honors for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mewling little high\NSchool just found you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a colossal dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you on the other\Nside, you murder-happy son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the end of that brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But damn him, why do I feel like I lost?
