Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an infuriating pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let him provoke me, but I still have a\Nminute before Josuke and Okuyasu show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought roughing the boy up\Nwould settle my turbulent spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't say I feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he be wearing\Nhis socks inside out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't bother him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the shoe store is this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This path will get us there faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your damn socks on right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gnawing unease is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means it's time to eradicate\Nyou like the bug you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tip of this figure can transform\Nanything it touches into a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for your execution, I think I'll\Nhave it transform your student badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bomb type one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a good job holding\Ndown the fork, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd be able to prop\Nyourself up with those injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have been\Nbetter off entering your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eternal slumber peacefully on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fairly certain I can see the trees\Nbehind you through your gaping wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice watch. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take one last look at\Nit, because I'm about to bust it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be clear, by it, I mean your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly are an\Nintriguing individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would love to learn your\Nname, among other things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I really must mosey\Nalong to my next destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a mere 20 seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mindless small talk just\Nisn't on the agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stans attack was surprisingly feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping that pitiful punch was\Nlike catching a little pup fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be an absolute\NNeanderthal to believe your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feebleness has no chance of\Novercoming Deadly Queen's power.
