Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you move so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief. I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up close that watch is tacky as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although to be fair, I'd say that's\Nthe least of your worries now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's something that's going to\Nlook a lot worse than that piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that, my friend, is your putrid face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, Dan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fast, it's like the\Ndamn thing has stopped time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, if you hadn't stepped up the way\Nyou did, I would have been long dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even all alone, you fought\Nvaliantly right up to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it, you've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi! Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we get here too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyes open, Okuyasu! Yeah, sure, but\Nwhat the hell did they get so messed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:16:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up calm down we have to find out if\Nthey're still alive if they are i can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heal him with Crazy Diamond. Yes,\NJotaro's alive! But he's barely clinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to life koichi is too but he's not\Nbreathing you gotta hurry up and heal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him, Josuke!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.99,0:16:15.12,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, he ain't wakin' up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna make it at this rate!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.62,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}But I already healed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Okuyasu
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.37,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's hurt really bad!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.37,0:16:22.33,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}It could take a while for him to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst day\NI've ever lived through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been one disaster after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira has always been able to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,overcome any obstacle\Nthat's gotten in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get out of this mess as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got beat to shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, turn around and don't try\Nanything funny. You got it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stay far away\Nfrom Mukadeya's shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another crazy explosion\Nmight go off! Get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first one came out of nowhere\Nand blew the owner to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were caught up in it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you also in the blast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an office worker who was\Nnearby, but now I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing way too much blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, man. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can heal you, lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, now tell me where it hurts most.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My midsection!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think one of my rips might\Nhave punctured my lung!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, hurry and save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty, huh? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I checked, I looked like I was\Njust an ordinary high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet you believed I\Ncould treat your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have trouble getting people\Nto let me into pachinko parlors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow I strike you\Nas a med school graduate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready and willing to fix\Nyour little boo-boos?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You totally took the bait,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means you have the ability\Nto see my shining diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got too excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must make you the killer we're\Nafter and they are your would-be victims
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems you finally hunted\Ndown your culprit. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you've been looking for\NMorio's resident killer You know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my identity the true nature of my\Nstand you even know my real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose sleeping like a baby\Nisn't really in the cards for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's just a temporary setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it look like I severed my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so excruciating, it's a\Nwonder I'm still conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much blood, look\Nat me, I'm a sobbing mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory and defeat mean\Nabsolutely nothing to me, kiddos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you I'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll live on in peaceful tranquility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true I'll have to\Nlive out the rest of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my days with the\Ninsatiable desire to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But make no mistake, I'll\Nhave my happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby free you, heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may act as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your final duty is to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this toy gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, that's a remote bomb stand\Nset to go after thermal energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is completely indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it hits you, your body\Ntemperature will set it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining diamond can't break the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would I do that\Nwhen I can fix it instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was kind enough to\Nleave his hand behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the prettiest sight to look at,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that hand is leading\Nus to our murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:20:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU'RE NOT GETTING AWAY FROM US\NTHAT EASILY, YOU FREAKING PSYCHO!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you girls seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I'll do whatever it\Ntakes to sleep peacefully again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is your face caked in blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it time to head home already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The murderer's name is Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His address is Mariah Kotodai 1128.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's 33 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, he wields a short-range\Nbomb stand called Deadly Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's this guy running to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we find him, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's holed up in this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beauty Institute Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would he\Ncome to a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Dr. Aya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aya, are you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Aya! She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell did she do to deserve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell could have happened in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that man isn't Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, his face is missing. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His fingerprints are too.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.28,0:21:54.20,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}He ain't got fingerprints on his right hand, neither. \NWho is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.12,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,{\an8}That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.46,0:21:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has the same height\Nand belt as the murderer.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.12,0:21:59.71,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's wearing the same suit that man was...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster brought him here and murdered\Nthe poor man right before my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.38,0:22:07.30,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,{\an8}He brought him into my salon... \Nand killed him before my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more ghastly than I imagined.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.05,0:22:10.97,Main,Aya,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's more terrifying than I imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He forced me to use Cinderella to replace
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his face as well as his\Nhair and fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying\Nhe's someone else now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His new face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.02,0:22:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Josuke, don't touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.70,0:22:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on the other side of that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But which one is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of these guys is Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gutless prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.54,0:23:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out here and face us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he managed to slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his new face he'll have\Nno reason to fear or hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bet your ass he'll\Nstay right here in Morioh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.86,0:23:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and go on living just as he always has.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.92,0:23:28.92,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tsuji Aya has died.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.05,0:23:27.30,Episode 24 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be10\pos(461.143,590.286)}Tsuji
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aya Tsuji deceased.
